.docs/decisions/0058-proactive-intelligence-maintenance.md:206:- Chose flag-not-merge for duplicate detection — auto-merging people records is dangerous (two different Sarah Chens at different companies). The system detects and flags; the user decides. This is P4 (Opinionated Defaults, Escapable Constraints).
