    54	- **W0 ships 1 agent instead of 2.** This is the system working: cycle-2 escalation prevented two PRs with shipped regressions.
    55	
    56	## What "parallel" means here
    57	
    58	Each agent in a wave gets:
    59	
    60	1. **A frozen contract.** The Linear ticket text — including the 2026-04-24 amendments — is the contract. Agents do not invent shapes.
    61	2. **An exclusive file/table allowlist.** Listed below per agent.
