45:The three modes have non-overlapping operational semantics summarized in [ADR-0103](0103-maintenance-ability-safety-constraints.md) §3. This ADR specifies how the service layer enforces them.
47:Throughout this ADR and its peers, `Evaluate` is the enum variant name. Prose references to "the evaluation harness" or "an evaluation run" refer to code operating under `ExecutionMode::Evaluate`.
