.docs/decisions/0105-provenance-as-first-class-output.md:237:1. Every field in the ability's domain output MUST have an entry in `field_attributions`. No "optional for Read" escape hatch — Read abilities' fields are typically `Direct` with `ConfidenceKind::Implicit`, which is trivial to populate but must exist.
